{"savedAt":"2026-11-04T18:46:25.137Z","id":"1e537cce-3401-4969-86b4-b259048f43a2","slug":"baggy-jeans-vs-skinny-jeans","title":"Baggy Jeans Vs Skinny Jeans. Pick Your Style","excerpt":"The eternal fashion debate: baggy jeans or skinny jeans? Both styles have their unique charm, catering to different aesthetics and body...","seoData":{"tags":[{"type":"meta","props":{"name":"description","content":"Baggy Jeans vs. Skinny Jeans: Which style suits you? Delve into the pros and cons of each, from comfort and versatility to body type and personal style."},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"title","children":"Baggy Jeans Vs Skinny Jeans.  Which is Better?","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"meta","props":{"property":"og:image","content":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/afb999_ecf65a3339d74b7ca6d1d31c2b1074c1~mv2.jpg"},"meta":{"width":1024,"height":1015},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"otn269316","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The eternal fashion debate: baggy jeans or skinny jeans? Both styles have their unique charm, catering to different aesthetics and body types. Let's delve into the pros and cons of each to help you decide which one suits your style and personality.","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"rgb(31, 31, 31)"}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1a4905601","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"if1zf5600","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"custom":"518"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"afb999_d7ef7514c9aa48bc8805b7ca9b045277~mv2.webp"},"width":1024,"height":1024},"disableExpand":true,"altText":"Skinny Jeans Vs Baggy Jeans","disableDownload":true}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dcopz5602"